```

#### 3.1.3. Danh sách các collection trong cơ sở dữ liệu

| Collection | Indexes |
|-----------|---------|
| users | email (unique), timestamps |
| farms | location (2dsphere), name+description (text), ownerId |
| products | name+description+tags (text), farmId, category, status, pricePerUnit |
| orders | customerId, farmId, status, orderNumber (unique) |
| posts | createdAt desc, title+body+hashtags (text), authorId, farmId, hashtags |
| notifications | userId + createdAt desc |

